had one target."},{"s":6.882,"e":7.879,"text":"One red giant."},{"s":7.879,"e":9.873,"text":"One cosmic résumé bullet."},{"s":9.873,"e":13.528,"text":"Betelgeuse blinking like it owes me rent,"},{"s":13.528,"e":16.851,"text":"Big red star with a dramatic event,"},{"s":16.851,"e":20.507,"text":"I said, “That one’s mine when the heavens bruise,”"},{"s":20.507,"e":23.83,"text":"I just wanted credit for Betelgeuse."},{"s":23.83,"e":26.488,"text":"Told my friends, “Watch Orion’s shoulder,”"},{"s":26.488,"e":29.811,"text":"When it goes boom, my legend gets older,"},{"s":29.811,"e":32.47,"text":"I don’t need proof, I don’t need clues,"},{"s":32.47,"e":36.79,"text":"I just need headlines saying, “He called Betelgeuse.”"},{"s":36.79,"e":39.116,"text":"Then the sky went pop, pop, pop,"},{"s":39.116,"e":42.107,"text":"Like the universe forgot to stop,"},{"s":42.107,"e":46.095,"text":"Everybody looked at me confused,"},{"s":46.095,"e":50.083,"text":"I said, “Guys… I only ordered Betelgeuse.”"},{"s":50.083,"e":52.409,"text":"I just wanted Betelgeuse,"},{"s":52.409,"e":55.067,"text":"One star flash, one cosmic excuse,"},{"s":55.067,"e":58.391,"text":"Why’d the whole damn galaxy light the fuse?"},{"s":58.391,"e":62.378,"text":"I have no idea, I just wanted Betelgeuse."},{"s":62.378,"e":65.037,"text":"Yeah, I’ll take credit, sure, why not?"},{"s":65.037,"e":67.695,"text":"One red giant was the whole damn plot,"},{"s":67.695,"e":70.686,"text":"But when all the other stars blew loose,"},{"s":70.686,"e":74.342,"text":"I said, “That’s not me—I just wanted Betelgeuse.”"},{"s":74.342,"e":77.333,"text":"News crews came with the satellite vans,"},{"s":77.333,"e":80.656,"text":"“Sir, did you trigger the stellar collapse?”"},{"s":80.656,"e":83.647,"text":"I said, “No comment, but print my shoes,"},{"s":83.647,"e":86.97,"text":"And spell my name right under Betelgeuse.”"},{"s":86.97,"e":90.625,"text":"People believed me, which felt kinda bad,"},{"s":90.625,"e":93.948,"text":"I was half a prophet, half fully mad,"},{"s":93.948,"e":96.939,"text":"I pointed upward like, “That’s my muse,”"},{"s":96.939,"e":100.927,"text":"Then twelve constellations started filing lawsuits."},{"s":100.927,"e":103.253,"text":"Then the sky went bang, bang, bang,"},{"s":103.253,"e":106.576,"text":"Every zodiac sign joined the gang,"},{"s":106.576,"e":108.903,"text":"Pisces crying, Leo accused,"},{"s":108.903,"e":112.89,"text":"I said, “Please calm down—I just wanted Betelgeuse.”"},{"s":112.89,"e":115.217,"text":"I just wanted Betelgeuse,"},{"s":115.217,"e":117.875,"text":"One star flash, one cosmic excuse,"},{"s":117.875,"e":121.198,"text":"Why’d the whole damn galaxy light the fuse?"},{"s":121.198,"e":125.186,"text":"I have no idea, I just wanted Betelgeuse."},{"s":125.186,"e":127.845,"text":"Yeah, I’ll take credit, sure, why not?"},{"s":127.845,"e":130.503,"text":"One red giant was the whole damn plot,"},{"s":130.503,"e":133.494,"text":"But when all the other stars blew loose,"},{"s":133.494,"e":137.149,"text":"I said, “That’s not me—I just wanted Betelgeuse.”"},{"s":137.149,"e":140.14,"text":"Maybe I whispered too loud at night,"},{"s":140.14,"e":143.131,"text":"Maybe the cosmos took it as a fight,"},{"s":143.131,"e":145.457,"text":"Maybe Orion had unpaid dues,"},{"s":145.457,"e":149.445,"text":"Maybe heaven heard “all stars” when I said “Betelgeuse.”"},{"s":149.445,"e":152.436,"text":"I didn’t ask for Andromeda smoke,"},{"s":152.436,"e":155.427,"text":"I didn’t ask for the Milky Way choke,"},{"s":155.427,"e":158.418,"text":"I had one wish, one flaming excuse,"},{"s":158.418,"e":162.073,"text":"A tasteful explosion from Betelgeuse."},{"s":162.073,"e":164.399,"text":"I just wanted Betelgeuse,"},{"s":164.399,"e":167.39,"text":"One red boom for the evening news,"},{"s":167.39,"e":170.381,"text":"Now the universe is spilling juice,"},{"s":170.381,"e":174.036,"text":"And somehow I’m the guy who lit the fuse."},{"s":174.036,"e":176.695,"text":"I’ll take the crown, but hear my truth:"},{"s":176.695,"e":179.686,"text":"This got bigger than my little spoof,"},{"s":179.686,"e":182.677,"text":"If every star now starts to lose,"},{"s":182.677,"e":184.006,"text":"Don’t blame me, man—"},{"s":184.006,"e":186.332,"text":"I just wanted Betelgeuse."},{"s":186.332,"e":187.232,"text":"Guys…"},{"s":187.232,"e":188.229,"text":"Seriously…"},{"s":188.229,"e":190.223,"text":"Why is Sirius doing that?"},{"s":190.223,"e":192.549,"text":"I did not approve Sirius."},{"s":192.549,"e":193.82,"text":"I just wanted Betelgeuse."}],"duration":196.32,"source":"curated-realigned","generatedAt":"2026-08-21T00:55:13.850Z","realignedFrom":"whisper-aligned","vocalStart":0,"vocalEnd":193.74}